455|
456|## Performance Tips
457|
458|1. **Limit light count**: Each light adds shader complexity
459|2. **Use baked lighting**: For static scenes, bake to textures
460|3. **Smaller shadow maps**: 512-1024 often sufficient
461|4. **Tight shadow frustums**: Only cover needed area
462|5. **Disable unused shadows**: Not all lights need shadows
